      "message": "These are still unclear for me, and can you give more explanation?\n\n* UNCHANGED: What does it stand for? What is the real mode if it is unchanged, but how to use it?\n* JOINT_STEREO / TWS_STEREO: What\u0027s the difference between them? Is JOINT_STEREO only for non-TWS headsets?\n* MONO / DUAL_MONO / TWS_MONO: What\u0027s the difference? Does TWS_MONO support DUAL_MONO?\n* EARBUD: Is the aptX frame only 16 bits length, or how can it be interleaved?\n\nIs there anything specific to QCOM TWS+ that the source side handles the earbuds left / right sides respectively?",
